# Changelog - Hope for All Foundation Website

All notable updates and commits to this repository are recorded below:

## [1.2.0] - 2026-08-12
### Added
- Integrated high-resolution Unsplash imagery across all pages.
- Embedded location map on `contact.html`.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-08-10
### Added
- Built structured form fields on `enquiry.html` for volunteer sign-ups.
- Added mission, vision, and team member sections on `aboutus.html`.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-05
### Added
- Initialized repository with basic HTML structure and navigation layout across all 5 pages.
